Capture-only patch for runs/2026-08-09-godot-prime-muse-1.2 (tools/capture_gameplay_godot.sh applies it to the
scratch copy in raw/_work; the archived project is never changed).

The desktop fallback in BirdPlayer._ready still hands the main view to XR (use_xr = true) when the OpenXR
interface exists but is not running, which is the case with --xr-mode off. The window then draws nothing
and Godot's movie writer crashes on the empty frame. This drops that one line; flight code is untouched.

